<h2>Build targets</h2>

<code lang=bash>
  slideit dev   my-talk/                       # dev server, live reload
  slideit build my-talk/ -o dist               # static website
  slideit build my-talk/ -t single -o talk.html  # one file, works offline
  slideit build my-talk/ -t pdf  -o talk.pdf   # PDF (Chromium needed)
  slideit build my-talk/ -t exe  -o talk       # standalone executable
</code>

<notes>
  static: any hosting, --base for sub-paths. single: everything inline as data URIs. pdf: --steps for one page per step. exe: Node single-executable app for the current platform.
</notes>
